OUT: TWIN-DUMP IDENTICAL   (both files 47185 bytes)
The guard is anchored at the bytes that actually moved: the dump contains
`>Expenses</th>` (the edited header line) and
`text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">$1,800.00</td>` (the edited row-cell line),
so the comparison is over the changed markup, not adjacent to it. Reason the
identity holds: for kpiType=="expenses" the switch sets `value = expAmt` and
MonthlyStat{Value: value, Expenses: expAmt}, so .Value == .Expenses; and the
`{{else}}` branch is unreachable for savings-rate/savings/income (their own
branches precede it).

